          "type": "richtext",
          "settings": {
            "content": "<h3><em>At The<\/em><\/h3><h1>STUDIO<\/h1><p><strong>THE HUB OF CREATIONS<\/strong><\/p><p>An accomplished business woman, SALLY SKOUFIS nurtures her Atelier group between Sydney, Paris and Thailand; the creative hub where ideas take shape, a special space where inspiration, collaboration and the human touch bring emotion and her poetry to exacting form.<\/p>"
          }
        }
      },
